From 7b54676dc468d52ff25b48ccf97018bdf6e57036 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Ren=C3=A9=20Dudfield?= <renedudfield@microsoft.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 09:32:14 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] app: Reset plugin-owned native menus on renderer reload

A renderer reload clears plugin registrations but leaves Electron's
current menu unchanged. Disabling a branding plugin can therefore retain
its Help links even though the plugin no longer runs.

Reset the native menu and plugin-loaded gate for each renderer document.
Add a real Electron regression, schedule it explicitly in desktop CI and
remove the optional mode guard so it cannot silently skip.

Document the test prerequisites and that menu customizations must be
registered again after reload.
